### TITLE:01daily
### TITLEINCREMENT:1
### DESTPATH:./tests/
### BAKPATH:./bak/
### RUNPATH:./run/
### LOGPATH:./logs/
### DATESUB:0
### UPDATE:0
### UPDATE_PREFETCH:NO
### NOPROXY_FETCHES:["rg"]
### PYTHON:python3

## Average amount of new posts per downloader:
## RV: 1200
## NM: 60
## RG: 120

## Do not create subfolder for this script

### ( ) ###
## In this category we scan last X ids for each downloader, let's call it 'IDs' category
# RV
# -2000
# downloader:D:/projects/RV/
## download everything available including unpublished posts, up to 30 min duration
# common:--log-level trace -timeout 20 -retries 20 -throttle 100 -lookahead 50 -fsdepth 2 -duration 0-1800
# common:--throttle-auto --no-rename-move --report-duplicates --check-title-pos --check-title-neg --solve-tag-conflicts --continue-mode
# common:--dump-tags --dump-descriptions --dump-comments --skip-empty-lists --merge-lists --download-without-proxy --predict-id-gaps auto
## Add base filters
## Here we use pretty much every tag syntax supported by the downloader
## Here filters are separated into 4 group: general, character / species, series / category, author / uploader
## Currently non-existing tags can be wildcard'ed to be future-proof
## RV filters are validated against tags/categories/artist
# common:-gay* -*yaoi -male/male -male_on_male -male_only -male_penetrating_male -(solo,male*|man|guy|1boy*|*femboy*) -solo_male -son -mother_and_son -brothers -scat -gore -guro -fart* -vomit -pmv* -hmv* -c[ou]mpilation* -c[ou]mpi`? -fap_`?hero -beat_`?banger -teaser* -advertisement -taker_pov -cuckold -vore -*_vore
# common:-orisa* -sanghe?li* -vulpera* -worgen* -pandaren -dog_b* -dogs -*knot* -cani* -were* -wolf
# common:-*steven_universe* -*transformers* -*second_`?life* -rick*morty* -american_dad -one_punch* -rayman* -*mlp* -my_little_pony* -*sonic* -*roblox* -minecraft -spyro* -amazing_world_of_gumball -*scooby* -*fnaf* -*five_nights* -the_sims* -*simpson* -*undertale* -*family_guy* -*futurama* -*team_fortess* -*crash* -*goof_troop* -*zootopia* -*adventure_time* -*animal_crossing* -teenage_mutant_ninja_turtles -*tmnt* -friday_night_f* -dragon*ball* -plants_vs* -ratchet_and_clank*
# common:-kenfurfox -prznai -bazett -ntrman -minwa -*shisui4sui* -*legendado* -double_soft_cream -futadomworld -toro_toro_resistance -purinpu -trestlesky* -axl020431 -u:*rusty?`?fc* -u:patreon?`?gamer -u:hdiddy?`? -u:top?`?heavy?`?production -u:drawwer -u:journal?`?jonathan2 -u:unival?`?
# sub:02s
-quality 1080p
sfw
# send

# sub:03l
## No need to explicitly exclude previous sub +filters so we just remove them
## Override quality for this sub onward
--quality -+1080p
-quality 720p
(long_hair*~long_le*)
-male_* -*_male -?male* -boy_* -*_boy -?boy* -male
# send

# sub:04s
## Here quality is still 720p
-+(long_hair*~long_le*)
safe
# send
# end


## This category results will be downloaded to the same folder as the first one: strip(" ") == string("  ") == ""
### (  ) ###
# RV
## Let's call this category 'Pages'. In this category we scan up to 50 pages...
# p50
## ...but only 2000 last ids
# -2000
## Configuration can be mostly copied from IDs category
# downloader:D:/projects/RV/
## Here '-fsdepth 1 -fslevel 1' is different because unlike IDs where optimized query would target top-level dest folder here each query will target separate subs each with its own subfolder
# common:--log-level trace -timeout 20 -retries 20 -throttle 100 -lookahead 50 -fsdepth 1 -fslevel 1 -duration 0-1800
# common:--throttle-auto --no-rename-move --report-duplicates --check-title-pos --check-title-neg --solve-tag-conflicts --continue-mode
## Here we do not use id gaps prediction because it cannot be used with search
